{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回はおもいっきし長文やったーー\nUPされてたの自分で読んでてもびっくりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼まで寝てた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋掃除しました。\nちょっと外走ろうかなって思ってたけど、\n走らなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走ればよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、運動したい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういや、この間学校の体力テストで\n50m走が8秒だった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しゅばっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑このデコメに関してのコメントがあったのですが、\nこれ、ゲームのキャラクターだとは\n知りませんでした‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい。\nちょ、ゆみ姉に詳しく聞いてみる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これわしのママも気に入ってんだ。\nしゅばっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日お兄ちゃんにアルバム入れてもらた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"andymori\nLUNKHEAD\nサカナクション\nBase Ball Bear\nASIAN KUNG-FU GENERATION\nRADWINPS"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい。\nクールだぜーーー‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんロックバンド詳しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしゃ、いっぱい聴いてさゆにゃんと話そう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかおもしろい写真撮ってないかなー\nて探してたらこれありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラインドからかっこ良く覗いてみた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジアムライブ前、\n真洋とどうやったらかっこ良く\n覗けるかやってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーもないとか言わんといて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、ものっそい踊りたい気分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやっ\nもうこんな時間だ‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/23/0903264/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}